{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChMnBjUng46asrmT2ZE7m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NJXuT67iqYdiRME9hroAb4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -i '' 's#(../proposal.md\\#rollout)#(https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/main/docs/proposal.md\\#rollout)#' docs/site/operations/gate-2-runbook.md\nsed -i '' 's#(runbooks/gate-2.md)#(site/operations/gate-2-runbook.md)#; s#docs/runbooks/gate-2.md#docs/site/operations/gate-2-runbook.md#' docs/proposal.md\ngrep -n \"gate-2\" docs/proposal.md | cut -c1-80; grep -rn \"runbooks\" README.md docs/layout.md docs/TODO.md | head\ncat > mkdocs.yml <<'EOF'\nsite_name: ard\nsite_description: Automated repository development\nsite_url: https://albertcbrown.github.io/ard/\nrepo_url: https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard\ndocs_dir: docs/site\nstrict: true\ntheme:\n  name: material\n  features:\n    - navigation.sections\n    - search.suggest\nplugins:\n  - search\nnav:\n  - Overview: index.md\n  - Install: install.md\n  - Getting started: getting-started.md\n  - Configuration: configuration.md\n  - Roles: roles.md\n  - Operations:\n      - operations.md\n      - Gate 2 runbook: operations/gate-2-runbook.md\n  - Security model: security.md\n  - Troubleshooting: troubleshooting.md\nEOF\ncat > docs/site/requirements.txt <<'EOF'\nmkdocs==1.6.1\nmkdocs-material==9.5.50\nEOF\nprintf '\\n# MkDocs build output\\n/site/\\n' >> .gitignore\ncat > docs/runbooks/pages-setup.md <<'EOF'\n# Publishing the docs site (human steps)\n\nAgents cannot write under `.github/`, so a maintainer does these steps once. The site is MkDocs Material, built from `docs/site/` with `mkdocs.yml`.\n\n## 1. Add `.github/workflows/docs.yml`\n\n- **Triggers:** `push` to `main` and `pull_request`, both with `paths: [docs/site/**, mkdocs.yml, internal/config/**, internal/cli/**, internal/docscheck/**]`.\n- **`build` job:** check out, set up Python and Go, `pip install -r docs/site/requir